WEBVTT

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.760
Seriously?

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:15.200
The town's full of youma!

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.380
Are people getting hurt?

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:19.560
I don't know.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.700
An evacuation order was issued, but...

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.210
Let's hurry!

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:35.560
Ikaruga-san!

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:36.770
Yomi-san?

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.130
Where are the Hanzo girls?

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:41.630
We got separated during the fight.

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:43.890
Just like me.

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:45.640
The enemy's strong.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:46.650
Yes.

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.400
But it's good to have you here.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:52.910
I'm glad to have you here, too.

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:55.990
Fuenzan!

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:09.880
There are a lot of youma out there.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.420
The shinobi are doing their best, but...

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:16.650
Lots of people are going to be hurt!

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:18.090
Which means...

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:18.920
Don't tell me.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:21.080
You're going to do it?

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:21.900
Yup!

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.480
Here I go!

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.210
Super Shinobi Kekkai Barrier!

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:44.030
A barrier this size will
minimize the damage.

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:46.030
But...

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:47.890
That's right.

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:49.040
This barrier will...

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:08.560
What's this?

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:10.320
A shinobi kekkai barrier!

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:24.580
All shinobi gain "Frantic" status!

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:43.100
<b><i>Sen</i></b>

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:43.850
<b><i>Ran</i></b>

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:44.560
<b><i>Kagura</i></b>

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:44.890
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.060
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.060
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:05.510
I can't fight like this!

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.970
You saved me, Yomi-san!

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:14.020
Ikaruga-san,

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:14.690
your breasts....

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:15.770
Your breasts!

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:19.280
Katsuragi-san!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:24.570
The super shinobi kekkai barrier
is what stole our clothes.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.300
It gave us "Frantic" status,

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.780
which increases our attack power.

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:33.060
I knew it...

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:36.040
So it's not that big of a deal.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:39.210
You fight like this all the time.

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:42.040
Not all the time!

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:44.050
Um, Ikaruga-san,

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.220
Katsuragi-san...

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:50.090
We've got a problem...

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.630
Homura,

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:57.190
I'm too embarrassed to fight like this!

00:04:58.680 --> 00:04:59.690
Yeah?

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:03.450
I have no feelings, so I don't get it.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.320
It doesn't bother me.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.200
Sure, not with boobs like that.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:13.240
Mirai,

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.910
there's no time for embarrassment.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.840
Let's go, everyone!

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:20.330
If anything,

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.590
I fight better in my underwear.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:27.250
I'm used to not wearing much, too.

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.700
Take this!

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.860
We need to be grateful
that we have no money.

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:44.590
Rasetsu,

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.680
I'm going down there, too.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:47.360
Okay.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:50.570
I'll kill the shinobi myself.

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:53.740
What do you want?

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:58.320
Gekkou...

00:05:58.320 --> 00:05:59.530
Senkou...

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.130
No.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.560
Fubuki-sama,

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:06.060
why are you doing this?

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.570
I told you.

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:09.340
To destroy the shinobi.

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:12.130
Is that what your justice is?

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.140
Yes.

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:19.460
We respected you.

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:22.660
Even if you throw us away,
that won't change.

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:25.650
But...

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:28.890
We cannot let you do this!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:33.490
We'll stop you.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:35.910
Don't make me laugh.

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.100
Juju!

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:57.970
Too easy.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:08.730
You still want to fight?

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:26.350
Beautiful...

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:28.010
So beautiful, Miyabi.

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.010
So cute...

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.340
So cute, Hibari.

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:37.060
Miyabi!

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:42.310
The super shinobi kekkai barrier is so great!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.090
Imu, what are you doing?

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:46.040
Yagyu-chan, take this seriously!

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.020
R-Right!

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:52.530
This is working!

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:55.280
Yeah, we're strong!

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:57.290
Both of you,

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:58.780
don't let your guard down!

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:08.850
Look at how many I beat!

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:14.320
This seems bad.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.210
What?

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:28.500
I-It keeps getting bigger.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:39.250
This is...

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:46.580
What?

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:51.720
What do we do against
a youma that big?

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:00.040
It's so fast!

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:00.620
Yumi!

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:02.430
Homura-san! Miyabi-san!

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.360
It grew larger?!

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:07.980
Be careful.

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.450
It's fast, too.

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:11.640
So it's big <i>and</i> fast?

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:12.650
That's a problem.

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:16.610
That means it's time for Ryona-chan!

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:23.290
Wh-What's that for?

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:26.780
I can tie myself up into
Japanese-style bondage!

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:28.390
Amazing, right?

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:30.120
Yumi-chan,

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.700
would you mind dripping
some hot wax on me?

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:34.130
Stupid dog!

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:35.190
Ryona,

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.830
you said you could help?

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:38.380
Do you have a plan?

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:39.920
I have a plan,

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:41.710
and I have ropes, too!

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.390
Look!

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:47.950
This rope is made
out of very tough material.

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:51.840
We'll use it to make a big rope
and tie up the youma!

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.150
What do you think?

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:55.800
It's worth trying.

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:58.660
Sounds fun. I'm in.

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:17.530
Let's go, Ryona!

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:18.210
Okay!

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:27.860
Now leave it to me!

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.850
Now it's done!

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:44.450
Go, now!

00:10:46.070 --> 00:10:48.200
Secret Ninja Art: Black Ice!

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:51.210
Secret Ninja Art: Resonate!

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:52.960
Secret Ninja Art: Purgatorio of Good and Evil!

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:55.220
Purgatorio of Good and Evil!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:56.520
Let's go!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.490
We did it!

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:15.730
Wow!

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.080
We've won.

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:20.250
Let's finish it!

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:21.120
No!

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:21.900
Asuka?

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:25.240
What do you mean, "no"?

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:27.740
Please, leave this to me!

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:30.620
Asuka-san?

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.690
Super Secret Ninja Art!

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:39.840
Fuma Korin!

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:46.800
"Fuma Korin"?

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:53.290
What is this?

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:56.720
What's going on?

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:11.340
Yes!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:11.330
We did it!

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:12.770
Well done, Asuka!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.340
Asuka-san?

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.520
That technique you used
to defeat the youma...

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:23.340
I didn't defeat it.

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:25.360
I sealed it.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:26.570
Sealed it?

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.290
Asuka-san?

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.520
"Fuma Korin"?

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:48.450
Fubuki-sama...

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.780
We can't...

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:56.420
...stop her?

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:02.460
Good work, everyone!

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:03.940
Kagura-san!

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:06.650
Asuka-chan, it worked, huh?

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:07.470
Yeah.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:09.990
Okay, I'll lower the barrier.

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:11.920
Wait, not yet.

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.420
Why?

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:16.040
The youma are gone, right?

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:17.080
No,

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:19.640
there's something more
dangerous than the youma.

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:22.730
It's...

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:25.630
<i>boobs</i>!

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:29.480
We need to beat them
by fondling them all!

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:30.580
No!

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:34.240
Kagura, ignore them.

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:35.920
Just lower the barrier.

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:36.750
Okay.

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:39.580
Aw, Sister Katsu...

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.420
Jeez...

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:47.110
<i>Asuka...</i>

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:49.770
<i>What are you keeping from me?</i>

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:59.770
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:59.770
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.030
Come on,

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.580
get your special Christmas discount!

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:07.410
Here you go.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.780
This is your only chance!

00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:12.600
You'll regret it if you don't!

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:14.520
Hey...

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:16.290
Homura, what's wrong?

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:19.030
You haven't said a word.

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:20.770
Sorry.

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.940
I was thinking.

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:28.000
We'll never get that
Christmas turkey at this rate.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.120
If that happens,

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:33.120
I'll just make a bean sprout
Christmas cake, though.

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.560
Oh, it's you guys.

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:40.630
That doesn't look
fun to wear in the cold.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:42.830
To a rogue shinobi,

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:45.070
a part-time job is an important mission.

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:48.310
But nobody's looking at you.

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.070
What?

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:51.070
You're right.

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:54.180
Oh no.

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:56.390
I'll have to do some kind of show—

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:59.550
I don't think that's why!

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:00.350
What?

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:02.720
You've got a better idea?

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:06.340
I sure do.

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:13.740
H-Hey!

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:15.640
What are you thinking?

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:22.620
Look at this crowd.

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:24.110
It worked great.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:29.040
Sheesh...

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:31.920
Suzune-sensei went to Kikai Dome.

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:34.470
She wanted you to
look after things here.

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:35.620
I see.

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.140
What's wrong?

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:42.060
Asuka's Fuma Korin...

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:43.090
Yeah,

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:44.890
I've never seen that before.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:49.370
Why did she want to seal
the youma instead of killing it?

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:50.960
No idea.

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:53.840
She's been really secretive lately.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.880
She doesn't tell me a thing.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:57.820
I see.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:16:01.120
But if she's siding with the youma,

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:03.200
I'll never forgive her.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:08.400
A shinobi's job is to eliminate
all youma, after all.

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:20.700
Asuka-san!

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:25.100
Yumi-chan!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:29.210
Want to talk for a little?

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.230
Talk about what?

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:47.450
First, drink some tea.

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:50.020
We can warm up before we talk.

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:53.570
Okay.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:58.850
It's good.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.700
Do you come here often?

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.210
Not lately.

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:05.920
But it's close to home,

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.020
so I used to come all the time.

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:10.740
On cold days like this,

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:12.210
I'd come with Grandpa.

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:14.230
I see.

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:18.220
You're looking a little better.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.370
Yeah?

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.220
I can't tell, myself.

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:28.930
Can you talk now?

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:30.980
Tell me what happened.

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:50.510
I won't kill you here.

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:55.300
I'll leave you alive to tell of the
terrible history of the shinobi.

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.500
I...

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:11.310
That is the sin of the shinobi.

00:18:24.960 --> 00:18:26.640
I'm sorry, but I can't.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:28.740
Asuka-san...

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.560
Asuka-san,

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:39.220
you're sure you can't tell me?

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.600
Then we're done being friends.

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.690
If I keep asking and you won't tell me,

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:54.940
we're not friends anymore.

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:56.610
No!

00:18:56.850 --> 00:19:00.500
I can tell you're carrying
some kind of burden.

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:04.620
But is it something
you must carry alone?

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:07.040
Let me carry it too,

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.600
as a fellow shinobi!

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:10.710
Yumi-chan...

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.620
It's okay!

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:13.930
No matter what it is,

00:19:13.930 --> 00:19:15.630
we can overcome it together!

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:23.890
Are you sure you don't want
to be my friend anymore?

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:26.530
You win, Yumi-chan.

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:29.920
Fine, I'll tell you everything.

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:31.810
Asuka-san...

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:35.400
Then I'll tell her myself.

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:42.170
Fubuki-san!

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:47.660
But first, tell me something.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:52.120
What is "justice" to a shinobi?

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:55.020
A belief we must protect.

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:57.130
Then what is this belief?

00:19:57.720 --> 00:20:00.630
To fight evil until the end.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.990
Evil...?

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:05.000
And what is that evil?

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:08.510
Where is it?

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:12.900
Ignorance really is a sin.

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:15.770
What do you mean?

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:21.200
The shinobi hunt youma like
beasts in the name of justice.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.780
Simply because they're "evil."

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:27.400
But what if the youma felt love,

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:28.790
just like humans?

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:34.040
What would you think
of what the shinobi did then?

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:37.130
I don't know what to say.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:41.280
I was told the youma were
evil and must be defeated.

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:46.560
So I don't think that the justice
of the shinobi is wrong.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:48.500
But...

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:51.560
If what you say is true, then...

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:54.850
I think that's unforgivable.

00:20:58.030 --> 00:21:00.420
Then I will show you.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:06.820
I'll show you proof that
the youma feel love.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:12.800
This aura is the same as a youma's!

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.090
But why?

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:15.730
Can't you tell?

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:22.340
It's because I am a child born
of a youma and a human!

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:29.900
I can feel it.

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:32.820
A new door to the other
world is opening.

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:33.560
What?

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:36.370
It's much bigger than the one before.

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:39.740
If it opens,
something terrible will happen.

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:41.370
Where is it?

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:43.320
Um...

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:50.320
That's the hot springs town!

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:53.570
The hot springs town?

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:55.170
Yup.

00:23:27.180 --> 00:23:28.840
The battle is just beginning!

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.340
Very well!

00:23:31.580 --> 00:23:34.340
So it's the final battle, huh?

00:23:35.770 --> 00:23:38.680
We're gonna have lots of fun
before the youma show up!

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:39.280
Yeah!

00:23:39.280 --> 00:23:41.360
Since we came to a hot springs town!
